WEBVTT

00:01.530 --> 00:04.670
Leaving behind countless thousands of tears

00:04.670 --> 00:08.200
My thoughts travel the wilderness

00:08.200 --> 00:16.130
The wounds will heal someday,
so come, trust myself

00:21.320 --> 00:27.960
Under the scorching rays of the sun,
what thoughts cross your mind?

00:27.960 --> 00:33.860
What does your grief-stricken gaze reflect now?

00:33.860 --> 00:42.800
If I can keep from losing my way,
step by step, it should be easy

00:42.800 --> 00:47.510
Like the wind

00:47.510 --> 00:50.580
Leaving behind countless thousands of tears

00:50.580 --> 00:54.080
I travel the dawn-lit wilderness

00:54.080 --> 01:00.660
The wounds will heal someday,
so come, trust myself

01:00.660 --> 01:07.400
Don't be afraid, change is
nothing to be frightened of

01:07.400 --> 01:13.540
As long as you are yourself, I will be with you

01:13.540 --> 01:20.210
Dreaming of tranquil days

01:20.210 --> 01:27.510
The roadless journey continues

01:41.860 --> 01:45.970
When was the last time we had a shower again?

01:45.970 --> 01:47.800
I forget.

01:49.800 --> 01:51.640
Hey, there!

02:00.380 --> 02:02.050
Ellis?

02:02.050 --> 02:03.720
I'm bored.

02:03.720 --> 02:06.420
Huh?

02:06.420 --> 02:08.720
I'm bored of walking.

02:08.720 --> 02:12.390
You keep saying that and
we'll be camping out again.

02:12.390 --> 02:15.560
You want to sleep staring up
at the stars again tonight?

02:23.240 --> 02:28.310
Just as if they were human,
life forms created by the hands of man

02:28.310 --> 02:32.080
sometimes develop strong
attachments to specific people.

02:48.760 --> 02:51.430
Ellis...

02:51.430 --> 02:59.010
That's right. This boy has no
comprehension of the position he is in.

02:59.010 --> 03:03.810
Therefore, it has been determined
that he is in need of reeducation.

03:03.810 --> 03:05.950
Use any means necessary.

03:05.950 --> 03:10.010
Please take him into custody immediately.

03:16.320 --> 03:18.220
I have a job.

03:49.660 --> 03:52.330
I'll come right back once the job's done.

03:52.330 --> 03:55.330
Wait here until I do.

03:55.330 --> 03:56.990
All right?

03:59.000 --> 04:00.700
Good girl.

04:29.530 --> 04:31.360
Ka-blam!

04:33.100 --> 04:34.800
Come on!

04:38.710 --> 04:41.810
Sheesh! Why won't they stop?!

04:41.810 --> 04:43.540
He sped up.

04:43.540 --> 04:45.810
What are we? Highwaymen?

04:48.220 --> 04:50.150
You're going to try?

04:52.220 --> 04:53.490
No way it's happening.

04:53.490 --> 04:56.820
A kiddy like you? No matter what you do...

05:07.270 --> 05:10.070
See? I knew it.

05:10.070 --> 05:12.910
- What?
- He stopped.

05:12.910 --> 05:14.640
You're kidding me!

05:14.640 --> 05:16.940
There's something messed up about this...

05:19.580 --> 05:22.950
You want to sleep staring up
at the stars again tonight?

05:27.020 --> 05:28.290
Once we get into town,

05:28.290 --> 05:31.460
shall we splurge a little and
find a nice hotel to stay in?

05:31.460 --> 05:33.260
You have money?

05:33.260 --> 05:35.200
I'll manage it somehow.

05:35.200 --> 05:39.600
Ah! I can't wait for the
hot shower and soft bed!

05:53.510 --> 05:55.510
Wow...

06:04.630 --> 06:05.830
It's big.

06:05.830 --> 06:08.630
For a hotel in the countryside, it's impressive.

06:10.030 --> 06:12.300
Oh, so that's why.

06:12.300 --> 06:13.700
What do you mean?

06:13.700 --> 06:16.140
It looks like there are ruins nearby.

06:16.140 --> 06:17.970
So, see?

06:20.580 --> 06:23.540
I'll go check us in. Wait here.

06:23.540 --> 06:25.240
Yessir.

06:53.940 --> 06:55.210
Who was that?

06:55.210 --> 06:57.180
Woohoo!

06:59.950 --> 07:01.570
Wait!

07:02.680 --> 07:06.220
We'll get the bed dirty,
so we'd better take a shower first.

07:06.220 --> 07:09.120
Come along now. Time for a shower.

07:15.900 --> 07:17.590
Woohoo...

07:23.070 --> 07:24.900
Soft...

07:29.040 --> 07:31.480
I feel alive again!

07:45.990 --> 07:48.630
That feels good.

07:48.630 --> 07:51.570
Oh? Did you cut your hair?

07:51.570 --> 07:53.800
- No.
- But...

07:53.800 --> 07:58.170
I feel like it's a little
shorter in the back now...

07:58.170 --> 08:00.070
Am I imagining things?

08:08.320 --> 08:12.120
To think you'd leave my
Ellis all by her lonesome...

08:23.930 --> 08:27.130
But it can't be helped, right?

08:32.870 --> 08:37.610
You lose sight of everything around
you when you fall in love, after all.

09:00.200 --> 09:03.740
I'm going to take this as a memento.

09:03.740 --> 09:07.540
Someday, we'll be bound
together. Until that day...

09:22.190 --> 09:25.760
You're so sweet, my Ellis.

09:25.760 --> 09:28.100
What're you doing, sonny boy?

09:28.100 --> 09:30.330
Is that some kind of magic?

09:37.340 --> 09:41.740
The perpetrator's whereabouts are unknown.
The weapon has yet to be identified.

09:41.740 --> 09:44.210
There are five or six victims...

09:44.210 --> 09:47.780
Oh, no... There may be more, depending...

09:47.780 --> 09:50.120
At any rate, we can't tell here on site.

09:50.120 --> 09:52.190
Please, just send the crime
scene investigators quickly.

09:52.190 --> 09:55.250
Um... someone good at... puzzles...

10:15.710 --> 10:17.450
I can't sleep.

10:17.450 --> 10:21.250
If you have any last words, say them now.

10:48.010 --> 10:50.610
That girl...

10:50.610 --> 10:53.100
She's waiting for someone.

11:12.030 --> 11:15.770
We barely have enough just to stay
here, so window shopping only, okay?

11:15.770 --> 11:18.830
You already said that earlier.

11:23.880 --> 11:25.210
She's there again.

11:25.210 --> 11:27.050
Who?

11:27.050 --> 11:28.780
That girl.

11:31.990 --> 11:35.510
Oh? That girl looks familiar...

11:38.730 --> 11:40.900
Uh...

11:40.900 --> 11:42.660
Oh, boy...

11:44.300 --> 11:45.790
Here.

11:50.840 --> 11:52.740
I remember now!

11:55.980 --> 11:57.910
You know her?

11:57.910 --> 11:59.880
I've met her once.

11:59.880 --> 12:01.870
I think her name was...

12:03.820 --> 12:06.220
Huh?

12:06.220 --> 12:11.890
I gave this to you the last time
we met. You still hadn't eaten it?

12:11.890 --> 12:13.720
Why not?

12:14.860 --> 12:16.690
You don't want it?

12:18.030 --> 12:20.870
Could it be that you don't like chocolate?

12:22.400 --> 12:24.740
Maybe she wants to eat it with you.

12:26.170 --> 12:30.610
I see. And that's why you
saved it with the wrapper intact.

12:33.910 --> 12:36.250
Wait, where are you going?

12:38.290 --> 12:42.190
She's... waiting for someone.

12:45.730 --> 12:48.060
Looks like the wrong person.

12:51.100 --> 12:52.570
Did you get that from her?

12:52.570 --> 12:54.470
Thanks.

12:54.470 --> 12:56.440
Oh, it's nothing...

13:00.310 --> 13:03.540
Come on, Lirio, let's go.

13:14.720 --> 13:16.990
Case of mistaken identity?

13:21.960 --> 13:24.730
Let's eat this together.

13:27.600 --> 13:29.590
That was delicious.

13:33.940 --> 13:35.910
You can have it.

13:42.180 --> 13:43.480
Now, then...

13:43.480 --> 13:46.850
We've got nothing to do, so how
about taking a nap or something?

13:53.030 --> 13:55.150
Wait, where are you going?

14:06.770 --> 14:09.970
Wow, I didn't know they
had facilities like this.

14:13.210 --> 14:16.880
Welcome, ma'am. What room are you staying in?

14:16.880 --> 14:18.520
This one...

14:18.520 --> 14:20.350
I am very sorry.

14:20.350 --> 14:25.130
Unless you are staying in a VIP room,
there will be an additional charge.

14:25.130 --> 14:29.320
We have to pay? Then we'll
just look around, so...

14:31.700 --> 14:33.720
- And a one, two...
- Oh, wait!

14:35.040 --> 14:36.740
Oh...

14:36.740 --> 14:40.370
There will also be a separate
charge for the swimsuit rentals.

14:42.380 --> 14:44.000
Whee!

14:51.420 --> 14:54.190
I thought we didn't have any money.

14:54.190 --> 14:56.090
It doesn't matter anymore.

15:13.340 --> 15:16.510
This feels so good.

15:16.510 --> 15:18.180
She fell asleep.

15:18.180 --> 15:22.210
Hey, now, sleep like that
and you'll get tummy troubles.

15:25.520 --> 15:28.060
She looks so cute asleep.

15:28.060 --> 15:30.260
She's like an angel.

15:30.260 --> 15:31.750
Yes.

15:38.730 --> 15:41.070
What's all this?!

15:41.070 --> 15:43.560
Lirio ordered it for us.

15:45.210 --> 15:47.610
Ordered it for us?

15:51.410 --> 15:55.220
At any rate, I don't have
anywhere near enough money.

15:55.220 --> 15:58.720
I'll explain it to you later, so could
you please do something about it?

15:58.720 --> 16:00.960
Please! I'm begging you!

16:00.960 --> 16:03.220
Oh, all right.

16:03.220 --> 16:06.930
I'll have it delivered to you in cash,
so can you get out tonight?

16:06.930 --> 16:10.260
The time? I don't have
the ability to be that specific.

16:10.260 --> 16:12.560
Okay, get ready to write this down.

16:14.270 --> 16:17.670
Huh?! W-Wait, you two...

16:19.970 --> 16:22.000
Nothing.

16:29.650 --> 16:31.850
You're going out?

16:31.850 --> 16:34.010
I'll be right back.

16:44.970 --> 16:46.970
The weather isn't looking too good.

16:46.970 --> 16:49.160
Talk about bad luck.

17:53.930 --> 17:56.230
What is he, a monster?

18:00.170 --> 18:04.710
Thanks to the rain, I guess
you can see my attacks.

18:04.710 --> 18:08.680
But you'll actually find
that it's to your detriment.

18:08.680 --> 18:11.950
Tell me, who are you?

18:11.950 --> 18:14.120
Well, not that it matters.

18:14.120 --> 18:18.760
No matter who you are, if you get in my way...

18:18.760 --> 18:21.630
...I'm not going to let you live.

18:21.630 --> 18:23.230
Uno.

18:23.230 --> 18:24.900
Dos.

18:24.900 --> 18:26.530
Tres.

18:41.720 --> 18:43.980
So you're waiting again tonight?

18:45.550 --> 18:47.650
You believe in him, huh?

18:51.590 --> 18:54.130
Maybe I'll wait, too...

18:54.130 --> 18:56.390
For her to come back.

19:06.410 --> 19:08.580
Aw, man...

19:08.580 --> 19:10.940
After I had that nice shower, too...

19:12.910 --> 19:15.580
I'd like to play with you more,

19:15.580 --> 19:18.120
but let's wrap this up soon.

19:18.120 --> 19:22.110
I have to go to Ellis tonight, after all.

19:23.920 --> 19:25.530
Uno.

19:25.530 --> 19:27.430
Dos.

19:27.430 --> 19:28.920
Tres!

19:38.540 --> 19:40.810
Don't underestimate me.

19:40.810 --> 19:45.150
I can break a mere human with one hand.

19:45.150 --> 19:46.850
Care to...

19:46.850 --> 19:48.610
...give it a try?

19:50.650 --> 19:53.790
Will you snap my neck first?

19:53.790 --> 19:56.520
Or will I pull the trigger first?

19:56.520 --> 19:59.660
We can see who's faster.

19:59.660 --> 20:02.130
You're...

20:02.130 --> 20:05.160
...pretty good for a human.

20:08.500 --> 20:11.990
Let's have drinks in Hell, amigo.

21:06.130 --> 21:08.120
Finally, it's here.

21:09.860 --> 21:11.570
Where did you go?

21:11.570 --> 21:13.730
Nowhere interesting.

21:13.730 --> 21:16.260
I guess she's still waiting.

21:21.980 --> 21:23.780
That man?

21:23.780 --> 21:25.370
Yes.

21:30.580 --> 21:32.880
We meet again.

21:34.290 --> 21:36.760
Is this a coincidence?

21:36.760 --> 21:39.730
Or is it?

21:39.730 --> 21:41.600
Thank you for looking after Lirio.

21:41.600 --> 21:43.090
Huh?

21:45.070 --> 21:48.500
I can tell. All I have to do
is look at her face.

21:54.440 --> 21:56.140
Bye-bye.

22:10.590 --> 22:12.420
No?

22:14.260 --> 22:16.090
No.

22:36.620 --> 22:40.350
Like a neverending summer

22:40.350 --> 22:43.890
Like flowers that never die

22:43.890 --> 22:47.790
Those arms you've wrapped around me

22:47.790 --> 22:55.960
Don't ever let go of me

23:02.210 --> 23:05.710
Even if I try clinging to you

23:05.710 --> 23:11.490
My heart still heeds a different evanescence

23:11.490 --> 23:15.420
Counting the rhythm of time by it

23:15.420 --> 23:19.560
A night of red stars

23:19.560 --> 23:23.560
The vanishing warmth

23:23.560 --> 23:27.500
I want to keep it here

23:27.500 --> 23:34.010
You, with your eyes closed

23:34.010 --> 23:37.940
Yearning over and over

23:37.940 --> 23:41.380
Even if I can't go anywhere

23:41.380 --> 23:45.420
When the heartache comes to a stop

23:45.420 --> 23:51.790
To the two of us, this moment is...

23:51.790 --> 23:56.790
...everything
